Summary:
During today’s session, the focus was on identifying and resolving errors present in the application. Various issues related to API handling, data flow, and minor frontend inconsistencies were analyzed and debugged. Systematic testing was carried out to trace the root causes of these errors. Necessary corrections were implemented to ensure smoother execution of the application.

Outcomes:
By the end of the session, most of the identified errors were successfully resolved. The application became more stable and reliable during execution. Improved error handling ensured better response to unexpected inputs and scenarios. Overall, the debugging process enhanced the robustness and correctness of the system.
